      "writtenOn": "2026-02-23T20:29:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should this silently skip or hard fail? I feel like failing would be less surprising to users and it matches the behavior when one change in the topic is invisible (L735).",
      "revId": "48c6e20e1f5be0ddb01e000380ec12244d1faa8f",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
