    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1f466293_6a3c5fa2",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/server/submit/MergeOp.java",
        "patchSetId": 26
      },
      "lineNbr": 752,
      "author": {
        "id": 1083225
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-23T20:34:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This might break callers incorrectly using this feature so I would be initially hesitant to \"fail\" since it would lead to a bigger issue for the caller.\n\nI am also worried that our internal customers force us to either revert this change while they update their tooling etc causing us to be in a difficult situation.\n\nIdeally I think an error makes more sense but I would say we first release with a silent failure to see the downstream effects of this fix and then update it to throw an error?\n\nWDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "20e14956_525fe4f2",
      "revId": "48c6e20e1f5be0ddb01e000380ec12244d1faa8f",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8bf57ae6_06785655",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/server/submit/MergeOp.java",
        "patchSetId": 26
      },
      "lineNbr": 752,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002666
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-23T20:38:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since any current tooling will have different behavior either way, I think the failure is better. Customers finding out in a month that something changed will still be an escalation + panic to figure out what to do about all the changes that weren\u0027t submitted that they expected to be submitted.\n\nIf you\u0027re that concerned about it, I would start with adding only the log message and not changing the behavior. Then you could reach out to customers proactively if you see log messages. I don\u0027t know how that works from a security release perspective though.",
      "parentUuid": "1f466293_6a3c5fa2",
      "revId": "48c6e20e1f5be0ddb01e000380ec12244d1faa8f",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "abe0f3d5_9c64ca3a",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/server/submit/MergeOp.java",
